# SPTOS web client — copy to web/.env.local and edit.
#
# Every value here is optional. Left unset, the app talks to its own origin and
# `vite.config.js` proxies /api and /socket.io to http://localhost:4000, which is
# what `npm run dev` from the repository root starts. That is the intended dev
# setup — you should not need this file at all locally.

# Absolute origin of the SPTOS API, without a trailing slash.
#
# Set this only when the client is served from a different origin than the API
# (for example the built PWA on a static host, with the server on Render). It is
# used for both REST calls and the WebSocket connection, so it must be an origin
# the server's CORS_ORIGIN allows.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://sptos-api.onrender.com
